{"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/garuda-shatrunjay","title":"Garuda Shatrunjay In Borivali West | Buy 1.5, 2 & 2.5 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nGaruda Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Garuda_group-Garuda_Shatrunjay--Bedroom-1655313019.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Garuda_group-Garuda_Shatrunjay--Bedroom-1655313040.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/garuda-group-garuda-shatrunjay-bedroom-1671457283.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/garuda-group-garuda-shatrunjay-bedroom-1671457300.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/garuda-group-garuda-shatrunjay-bedroom-1671457369.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150622102551-NewProject(54).png)\n\n# Garuda Shatrunjay\n\nGaruda Shatrunjay ,Ram Baug Lane, Swami Vivekananda Rd, Borivali, W, Maharashtra 400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹1.29 Cr - 2.11 Cr\n\n₹1.29 Cr - 2.11 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nIntroducing Garuda Shatrunjay, an exceptional project offering thoughtfully designed apartments at affordable prices. Located in Borivali, Garuda Shatrunjay promises a lifestyle fit for royalty. Whether unwinding after a long day or enjoying a peaceful retreat, this residence provides a serene escape from the bustling city life. A standout feature of the project is its proximity to the Jain Derasar, which serves as a significant focal point. Additionally, Garuda Shatrunjay boasts outstanding connectivity to major landmarks and essential locations, including renowned hospitals, schools, supermarkets, parks, entertainment venues, and leisure centers.\n\n1.5 BHK, 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2024\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹24,500/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n527 - 888 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Surrounded by eco-friendly surroundings.\n* Perfection is second nature.\n* Located in the heart of the city.\n\n* Strategically constructed.\n* Good lighting and ventilation in all rooms.\n* Access to important landmarks.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nOverall Rating: The project maintains a high rating of 4.6 stars on Google based on over 50 reviews, reflecting strong buyer satisfaction. Spiritual Theme: Many reviewers appreciate the unique design inspiration from the Jain Derasar, which creates a peaceful and spiritual living environment. Architectural Scale: Residents and prospects frequently mention the 41-story height, noting it as one of the tallest and most prominent landmarks in the immediate vicinity. Connectivity Focus: Reviews highlight the strategic location near SV Road, with easy access to the railway station and the upcoming metro line. Amenities Quality: Positive feedback is directed toward the rooftop facilities and the 30-foot waterfall feature, which are seen as premium additions for the price point.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nSpiritual Environment\n\nThe inclusion of a Jain Derasar within the premises is a significant advantage for religious families.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nThe project offers extensive facilities including a rooftop garden, gymnasium, and a grand entrance lobby.\n\nStrategic Location\n\nIt is situated in a well-developed part of Borivali West with close proximity to schools like Himalaya High School and various healthcare centers.\n\nNatural Ventilation\n\nThe architectural design ensures that all rooms receive adequate sunlight and cross-ventilation.\n\nHigh Connectivity\n\nThe site provides quick access to Western Express Highway and SV Road, simplifying commutes to other parts of Mumbai.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nHigh Property Rates\n\nThe premium pricing and rising square foot costs in Borivali West may make it less accessible for budget-conscious buyers.\n\nHeavy Traffic\n\nThe surrounding Ram Baug Lane and SV Road areas experience significant congestion and bottlenecking during peak hours.\n\nLimited Open Space\n\nSome residents have noted that while internal amenities are good, there is limited ground-level open space for outdoor activities.\n\nNoise Pollution\n\nBeing located in a busy urban pocket near major roads can lead to high noise levels for lower-floor apartments.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nThere have been occasional mentions of limited space for visitor parking within the complex.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nIdeal for spiritual families\n\nGood for high-rise lovers\n\nGreat for local commuters\n\nAvoid if seeking quiet suburbs\n\nStrong investment potential\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Library-And-Busi