9 Cr - 2.18 Cr\n\n### Where is Garuda Shatrunjay located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nGaruda Shatrunjay is located at Garuda Shatrunjay ,Ram Baug Lane, Swami Vivekananda Rd, Borivali, W, Maharashtra 400092.\n\n### What configurations are available in Garuda Shatrunjay?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nGaruda Shatrunjay has 1.5 BHK, 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Garuda Shatrunjay?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Garuda Shatrunjay is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Garuda Shatrunjay?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Library And Business Centre, Swimming Pool, Table Tennis, Walking Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Garuda Shatrunjay?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Garuda Shatrunjay is Garuda Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Garuda Shatrunjay:Garuda Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150622102551-NewProject(54).png)\n\n## Garuda Group\n\nGaruda Group is a renowned name in the Indian real estate industry, known for its commitment to excellence and innovation. With a passion for creating exceptional living spaces, Garuda Builders has set a new benchmark in the industry with its attention to detail, craftsmanship, and quality. The company's portfolio includes a range of luxurious residential and commercial projects, each one offering a unique blend of style and sophistication. Their commitment to customer satisfaction is evident in every aspect of their projects, from the design and construction to the after-sales service. With a team of skilled professionals and a dedication to delivering the best, Garuda Builders is a trusted name among homebuyers in India.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/konark-developer-konark-32-west-view-elevation-1779782095.webp)\n\n![Konark 32 West View](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150923041604-newproject-3.webp)\n\nKonark 32 West View\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.35 Cr - 7.71 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4.5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dotom-realty-dotom-vue-elevation-1747896338.jpg)\n\n![Dotom Vue](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/111125030803-dotommvlogo.webp)\n\nDotom Vue\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹95 L - 1.5 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dgs-group-builders-dgs-sheetal-shashank-elevation-1754035295.jpg)\n\n![DGS Sheetal Shashank](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/230822105140-newproject-2022-08-23t105040950.png)\n\nDGS Sheetal Shashank\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.05 Cr - 1.77 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-1747641591.jpg)\n\n![Paradigm Anantaara](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/201221111027-PARADIGM.png)\n\nParadigm Anantaara\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹2.28 Cr - 3.71 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/khandelwal-groupe-khandelw