  Floor\n* 20   \n  Floor\n* 19   \n  Floor\n* 18   \n  Floor\n\n* 5701\n* 5701\n* 5701\n* 5701\n\n#### Garuda Shatrunjay\n\n* Unit Plan\n* Floor Plan\n\nCarpet Area\n\n###### Flat Configuration\n\n#### Property Listings of Garuda Shatrunjay\n\nShow only* For Rent\n* For Sale\n\nLast Sale Transaction\n\n#### 63.40 L\n\n---\n\n## View Latest Sale Transactions for Garuda Shatrunjay\n\n[![Transaction](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/6597de503fbc0da68da0b7a2/556db122-4933-40b1-b36a-29418dfa78ae_ShreeUmiyaGarudaShatrunjayElevation.jpg)](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/6597de503fbc0da68da0b7a2/556db122-4933-40b1-b36a-29418dfa78ae_ShreeUmiyaGarudaShatrunjayElevation.jpg)\n\n###### Flat Configuration\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\nBalcony\n\nEnclosed Balcony\n\nTerrace\n\nDry Area\n\nTotal Carpet Area\n\n* [Unit Details](#stackViewTab)\n\n### 1004\n\nNo of BHK\n\n### 1004\n\nFlat No\n\n### sqft\n\nArea\n\n---\n\nPlease Login to Check Latest Transactions\n\n#### Property Listings of Garuda Shatrunjay\n\nShow only* For Rent\n* For Sale\n\n---\n\n## Property Listing in this Project\n\nBuy Rent\n\nNo data Found\n\nNo data Found\n\n---\n\n# Garuda Shatrunjay – Your Dream Home, Backed by Trusted Financial Partners!\n\nGaruda Shatrunjay has become a preferred choice for homebuyers, with numerous flats sold to happy owners. These homeowners have been supported by some of India’s most reliable banks and housing finance companies (HFCs), providing a seamless and secure home loan experience.\n\n## About Garuda Shatrunjay\n\nGaruda Shatrunjay is a residential project located in Borivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Garuda Developers, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers low budget apartments with different configurations, including 2 & 3 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 7,000. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 2 BHK are in the range... Read More\n\nGaruda Shatrunjay is a residential project located in Borivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Garuda Developers, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers low budget apartments with different configurations, including 2 & 3 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 7,000. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 2 BHK are in the range of 527 - 778 sqft. The area of 3 BHK are in the range of 860 - 888 sqft. A 2 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 36.8 lakhs. A 3 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 60.1 lakhs.\n\nThe prime location of Garuda Shatrunjay is a significant advantage for prospective homebuyers, as it is positioned in one of Mumbai's most desirable neighbourhoods. Borivali West, an already well-developed area, provides excellent connectivity to the rest of the city. The project enjoys close proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro stations, and bus stations, resulting in reduced commuting time for office-goers. Additionally, the neighbourhood offers abundant options for retail shopping and fulfilling daily needs.\n\nOverall, Garuda Shatrunjay is an exceptional residential project that ensures a comfortable living experience for its residents through its top-notch amenities and outstanding location.\n\n---\n\n##### More info about Garuda Shatrunjay\n\n* About Locality\n* Investments\n\nCommuting is effortless thanks to the Western Express Highway, Magathane Metro Station, & the Borivali Railway Station. There are plenty of business centers, healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities**\n\n·       Surbhi Life Care Hospital\n\n·       Lifeline Medicare Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions**\n\n·       Cambridge School\n\n·       Oxford International School\n\n·       JCBN International School\n\n**Shopping Complexes**\n\n·       Thakur Mall\n\n·       Growel€™s 101 Mall\n\n·       Raghuleela Mall\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n·       Agora Business Plaza\n\n·       Mahindra & Mahindra\n\n·       Wadhwa Technopark\n\n**Day Outing**\n\n·       Sanjay Gandhi National Park\n\nBorivali West is known for being a prime location for residences as numerous residential complexes are housed there along with many posh and upmarket multi-story buildings. Job opportunities in Borivali are plenty as many companies have their offices in this prominent Mumbai suburb. Whether you want luxury homes or budget apartments, this locality has it all! Moreover, Borivali is excellent when it comes to public commuting thanks to the Western Express Highway, Borivali Railway Station and the Mumbai Rapid Metro opening multiple stations in this area. This is expected to drive property rates upward considerably in the coming years.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/6597de503fbc0da68da0b7a2/556db122-4933-40b1-b36a-29418dfa78ae_ShreeUmiyaGarudaShatrunjayElevation.jpg)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Similar Properties\n\n[![CCI Rivali Park Sunburst-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/658a8dfc3fbc0da68da0b0ea/8215b488-3e28-44d0-92ec-045871e77460_Screenshot2023-12-26140401.png)\n\n#### CCI Rivali Park Sunburst\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2 & 3 BHK Flats\n\n1.6 Cr-2.3 Cr](/properties/details/cci/borivali-east/cci-rivali-park-sunburst/658a8dfc3fbc0da68da0b0ea)\n\n[![Sheth Grandeur Tower-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/638385c42c2ad67a388573d7/ee14d33b-9f54-4f67-bffb-6c2859e427f9_elevation.png)\n\n#### Sheth Grandeur Tower\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n2 & 3 BHK Flats\n\n1.9 Cr-2.7 Cr](/properties/details/sheth-creators/kandivali-east/sheth-grandeur-tower/6